TITLE Calcite kinetics at 200C, pH 2, Cu and Ba
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5
    -water 1
KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -tol 1e-10
    -steps 10*10 90*10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -head step totC totCu
    10 PUNCH STEP_NO, TOT("C"), TOT("Cu")
END
